      "label": "Barcode Type",
      "options": "Code 128\nCode 39\nQR Code",
      "default": "Code 128",
      "description": "<b>Code 128</b> — recommended for all modern 1-D laser/CCD scanners (supports full ASCII).<br><b>Code 39</b> — for legacy scanners; limited to A-Z, 0-9 and a few symbols.<br><b>QR Code</b> — for 2-D / smartphone scanners."
